  <Properties>
    <Name>JFD's and Pouakai's Mercenaries</Name>
    <Teaser>Adds a system for the recruitment of [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]Mercenaries[ENDCOLOR] to the game.</Teaser>
    <Description>See CivFanatics or Steam Workshop for full details.</Description>
    <Authors>JFD, Pouakai, Janboruta, Sukritact</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>Zwei833, Kesler, Hypereon, TranquilSilence, Sub6</SpecialThanks>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
